1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,444
Meet Ari, an AI assistant.

2
00:00:02,444 --> 00:00:07,004
Daniel has an overdue bill of seven hundred ninety-nine baht.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:12,258
Daniel asks how he can pay, and what happens if he pays late.

4
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:19,098
Next, he asks why the bill is higher, and how many points he has.

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:23,788
Daniel switches to Thai, and Ari carries on in Thai.

6
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:29,799
He interrupts the bill to ask for a roaming pack for Japan, and Ari offers three packs.

7
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:34,075
He picks the seven day pack, then Ari brings him back to the bill.

8
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:40,571
Ari offers a privilege for his one thousand one hundred eighty points.

9
00:00:40,571 --> 00:00:43,967
Daniel redeems a LINE sticker set and gets a coupon.

10
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:49,736
He promises to pay on Friday, and Ari saves it.

11
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:53,847
Ari asks for a quick rating and thanks him.

12
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:00,082
The chat closes, ready for the next customer.
